## Ontology Studio entity panel: tabs grouped by what each section does
================================================================================

Context:
The entity panel's Actions tab mixed three features with different effects
(UC functions return a result, Jobs start a background run, business rules
write inferred triples to the graph) with nothing telling them apart. The
same one-parameter UC function picker was split across two tabs (virtual
attributes under Attrs., actions under Actions), "Business rules" clashed
with the Ontology → Business Rules page that hosts several rule types, and
Refs. mixed presentation links (dashboard, dataset) with a semantic link
(bridges). Tabs are now grouped by purpose. Labels were measured in the
browser: the full-word set needed ~428px of the 382px rail at the default
420px panel width, so "Attrs." stays abbreviated and the axioms tab is
"Model" (rail now 382/382px).

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-shared-panels.js
   Entity rail is General / Attrs. / Model / Behaviour / Links
   (ids details / attributes / model / behaviour / links; unknown remembered
   ids fall back to General via ``ENTITY_PANEL_TABS``). General: name, label,
   icon, description, group. Attrs.: mapped attributes only. Model: inherits
   from, inherited relationships, equivalent to, disjoint with, bridges.
   Behaviour: virtual attributes, functions, jobs, inference rules (SWRL),
   each heading tagged with an icon + text effect chip (Computed when viewed /
   Returns a result / Runs in background / Writes to the graph, the last in
   the warning tone); headings wrap so the Add button stays visible on narrow
   panels. Links: dashboard, dataset. "UC functions" → "Functions",
   "Business rules" → "Inference rules (SWRL)" with matching empty states,
   remove titles, picker title and toasts. Relationship rail Details → General.
2. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Entity right-click shortcuts mirror the new tabs (General, Attributes,
   Model, Behaviour, Links); relationship shortcut Details → General.
3. src/front/static/ontology/css/ontology-shared-panels.css
   ``.entity-effect-chip`` size rule for the Behaviour chips.
4. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js,
   src/front/static/query/js/query-entity-details.js,
   src/front/static/query/js/query-business-rules.js
   Graph Explorer details section and node right-click header say
   "Inference rules". Stored class fields (``actions``, ``virtualAttributes``,
   ``business_rules``), endpoints and MCP policy keys are unchanged.
5. tests/units/front/test_entity_panel_tabs.py (new)
   Pins rail order/labels, the fallback, each pane's contents, the four
   effect chips and the warning tone, the relationship rail, the Designer
   shortcuts and the Explorer wording (red before the change).
6. tests/units/front/test_map_context_menu_tabs.py,
   tests/units/front/test_class_actions_ui.py,
   tests/units/front/test_entity_business_rules_ui.py,
   tests/units/front/test_ontology_split_panel_layout.py,
   tests/units/front/test_ontology_map_external_badge.py
   Updated to the new tab ids and pane boundaries; the superseded
   Infos/Attrs. label test is removed.
7. docs/user-guide.md, docs/api.md, releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.9.0.md
   Steps point at Behaviour → Functions / Virtual attributes; new
   "Inference Rules on an Entity (SWRL)" and "Entity Panel Tabs" sections;
   release note describes the new tabs.

Browser check (local dev server, TestZeroCopy domain, Playwright): rail
382/382px at 1440px, all five tabs rendered and screenshotted, keyboard Tab
moves focus along the rail, Behaviour headings wrap at a 390px viewport,
no console or page errors.

